{"id":"e9bfb3f7429ec2a6","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-prop-forcing.md","title":"Forcing Properties","display":"prop-forcing — Forcing Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-forcing","aliases":["58-prop-forcing"],"display":"prop-forcing — Forcing Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-forcing — Forcing Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,G\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (poset predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (fully parameterized generic-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\n\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\n\\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq P\n\\land G\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;\n(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;\n(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\n\\Bigl(\nD\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\n\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\n\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\n\\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq P\n\\land G\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;\n(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;\n(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\n\\Bigl(\nD\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\n\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>With the forcing convention “smaller means stronger,” filters are upward closed and directed toward stronger common extensions.</li>\n<li>Genericity additionally requires meeting every dense subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> belonging to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The order is explicit on both sides; the three-argument compatibility predicate would existentially choose an order and would not characterize genericity for the displayed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-dense.md","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CTM}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (fully parameterized generic-filter predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\n\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\to\\\\\n&\\quad\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\n\\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq P\n\\land G\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;\n(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;\n(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\n\\Bigl(\nD\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\n\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P","display":false}],"bytes":1715,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3962","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-prop-forcing.md|58-prop-forcing]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["d06ac5a66d69d291","545853811ce0a4b6","d3f859dbdd37f018","1331244a5201bb99","681e6314e26cdd0b","66d43bb76d055059"]}